Implemented all requested SOS cards — `sos_1`, `sos_4`, `sos_13`, `sos_57`, `sos_97`, `sos_120`, `sos_201`, `sos_226`, `sos_245`, and `sos_257` — with one commit per card.

The run also added the supporting engine surfaces those cards needed, including stack-to-graveyard replacement handling, trigger target carry-through, explicit colorless handling, skip-turn bookkeeping, miracle/alternate-cast windows, shared casualty casting, permanent-granted cost reductions, restricted/source-tagged mana, and shared creature-state support for animated permanents. `KEY_DECISIONS.md`, `RUN_DECISIONS.md`, `FILES_MODIFIED.json`, and `MODEL_AUDIT.jsonl` were updated as directed.

